{"title":"Dune Captain","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 45 Raider that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 7 times (2.3% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/dune-whetstone\">Dune Whetstone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-captain\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-captain?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>312</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-captain?lv=46\">Lv 46 <span>329</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/dune-captain?lv=47\">Lv 47 <span>333</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-captain?lv=48\">Lv 48 <span>260</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-captain?lv=49\">Lv 49 <span>99</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-captain?lv=51\">Lv 51 <span>28</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-captain?lv=45\" title=\"Pick level 45\"><td><b>45</b> 